Recipe: 
About 10 peaches 
Cinnamon 
Nutmeg
Lemon Juice
Cornstarch 
Rolled oats(M toasted hers in a skillet first with more warm spices!) 
Cold cubed butter 
Preheat your oven to 350F and bake for 15-18 minutes until golden and bubbling! 

Measurements are from the heart 💜 
Let us know in the comments if yall want more recipes! 

Don’t forget to checkout the new episode on Spotify, Apple Podcasts, and Amazon Music! We truly love all the support!! 

