></div></div></a></div></div><div class="_ac7v x1ty9z65 xzboxd6"><div class="x1lliihq x1n2onr6 xh8yej3 x4gyw5p x14z9mp xhe4ym4 xaudc5v x1j53mea"><a class="x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x1ejq31n x18oe1m7 x1sy0etr xstzfhl x972fbf x10w94by x1qhh985 x14e42zd x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 x3ct3a4 xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz _a6hd" href="https://www.instagram.com/chittinnchattin/reel/DVw36HmEYuj/" role="link" tabindex="0"><div class="_aagu"><div class="_aagv" style="padding-bottom: 133.333%;"><img alt="“let’s start a podcast”… famous last words, tehe 🤍

12 weeks ago we had an idea, a couple microphones, and absolutely no clue what we were doing. since then we’ve learned so much — about technology, about ourselves, and about what we’re actually capable of when we just go for it.

two besties trying to create a little space for healing in the world… full of grace, a little chaos, lots of laughter, a few tears, and a whole lot of memories along the way.

thank you for being here and joining us on this adventure. we’re just getting started — and we can’t wait to see where it goes.

cheers, y’all ☕️🎙️
